    "(pulled from the live feed service on 2026-08-09, HTTP 206 on both mp4 and png).",
    "caption / duration_seconds / like_count / creator_handle are SYNTHETIC \u2014",
    "they are precisely the fields the backend does not yet return. See",
    "docs/video-feed-web-contract-2026-08-09.md."
